  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Feedback & Iteration Support\r\n\r\nUse this chat to think through feedback you received and decide how to respond to it. It can help you reflect on what to change, what to keep the same, and how those decisions affect users, usability, and impact.\r\n\r\nThis chat supports **judgment and reflection**, not planning tasks or adding new features.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n> I received feedback on my app and I’m not sure what to change versus what to leave as is. Can you help me think it through?\r\n\r\n> Some feedback conflicts with my original goals. Can you help me decide what matters most?\r\n\r\n> I made a few changes based on feedback, but I’m not sure how to explain why I chose those changes. Can you help me reflect?\r\n\r\n> I’m worried about how my design decisions affect different users. Can you help me think about impact or unintended consequences?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
